{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "mayday_engine_fire",
    "name": "Mayday - Engine Fire",
    "brief": "Speedbird three nine four declares Mayday with engine fire and smoke in the cockpit. Heavy traffic in the sector. Player must clear a corridor, vector the emergency aircraft straight to the runway, and keep the other six contacts well clear without trampling their flight paths. Single-aircraft priority handling under traffic pressure.",
    "location": "Main Sector",
    "roe": "ICAO Mayday doctrine. Emergency aircraft has absolute priority; all other traffic vectored clear. Speak \"BAW394, vector 270\" / \"DLH456, vector 360\" etc. to clear the corridor. Aircraft will burn down to a fuel-style cascade if not landed within seven minutes.",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "keepLevelZones": false
  },

